OL,3,AWoman detained indefinitely for
OL,4,Astabbing two boys
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who stabbed two 10-year-old
OL,7,Fboys has been detained indefinitely in
OL,8,Fa psychiatric hospital.
OL,10,FArmed police found the injured boys
OL,11,Fafter forcing their way into a flat in
OL,12,FFriskney in November 2022 following a
OL,13,Fstand-off lasting several hours.
OL,15,FAnn Marie McEvoy, 45, of Church Walk,
OL,16,FColchester, was tasered and arrested.
OL,17,FIn July, she pleaded guilty to two
OL,18,Fcounts of attempted murder.
OL,20,FOn Friday, she was sentenced to a
OL,21,Fhospital order under the Mental Health
OL,22,FAct at Lincoln Crown Court.
